1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,740
AutoLander helps your team post

2
00:00:01,740 --> 00:00:02,840
inventory to Facebook

3
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:04,220
Marketplace and keep

4
00:00:04,220 --> 00:00:05,320
those listings current.

5
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:06,670
Let's walk through it,

6
00:00:06,670 --> 00:00:07,690
starting with where

7
00:00:07,690 --> 00:00:08,980
your inventory comes from.

8
00:00:09,227 --> 00:00:10,437
In Configuration,

9
00:00:10,487 --> 00:00:12,177
open Inventory Feeds.

10
00:00:12,177 --> 00:00:13,427
You have two ways

11
00:00:13,427 --> 00:00:14,447
to bring vehicles into

12
00:00:14,447 --> 00:00:16,437
AutoLander: a supported website,

13
00:00:16,567 --> 00:00:17,737
or a data feed

14
00:00:17,737 --> 00:00:19,077
from your inventory provider.

15
00:00:19,347 --> 00:00:20,367
Either way,

16
00:00:20,367 --> 00:00:21,777
the goal is the same.

17
00:00:22,017 --> 00:00:23,037
Your team works

18
00:00:23,037 --> 00:00:24,117
from the inventory you

19
00:00:24,117 --> 00:00:25,357
already have, without

20
00:00:25,357 --> 00:00:27,147
entering every car from scratch.

21
00:00:27,657 --> 00:00:29,397
Website Scrape lets you enter

22
00:00:29,397 --> 00:00:31,197
your dealership's Cars dot com

23
00:00:31,197 --> 00:00:33,547
or CarGurus inventory URL.

24
00:00:33,797 --> 00:00:35,707
A custom dealership website

25
00:00:35,707 --> 00:00:37,847
can work too, once AutoLander

26
00:00:37,847 --> 00:00:39,417
confirms that site is supported.

27
00:00:39,847 --> 00:00:41,957
Paste the URL, verify it,

28
00:00:41,957 --> 00:00:43,067
and connect the website.

29
00:00:43,387 --> 00:00:44,437
Data Feed is

30
00:00:44,437 --> 00:00:45,457
the other option.

31
00:00:45,507 --> 00:00:46,527
You can use

32
00:00:46,527 --> 00:00:47,587
a feed link or connect

33
00:00:47,587 --> 00:00:48,927
with your inventory provider,

34
00:00:49,067 --> 00:00:50,717
including through SFTP.

35
00:00:50,967 --> 00:00:52,947
For dealer and team plans,

36
00:00:53,157 --> 00:00:54,377
AutoLander can help

37
00:00:54,377 --> 00:00:55,487
set that up with systems

38
00:00:55,487 --> 00:00:56,507
such as vAuto.

39
00:00:56,507 --> 00:00:58,167
Once the vehicles appear,

40
00:00:58,167 --> 00:00:59,427
check that you have

41
00:00:59,427 --> 00:01:00,927
the right store and inventory.

42
00:01:00,927 --> 00:01:02,427
If your manager

43
00:01:02,427 --> 00:01:03,997
has already connected it, you're

44
00:01:03,997 --> 00:01:05,067
ready to use that feed.

45
00:01:05,067 --> 00:01:06,767
Now you can work straight

46
00:01:06,767 --> 00:01:07,787
from that inventory.

47
00:01:07,787 --> 00:01:09,397
In Post to Market,

48
00:01:09,397 --> 00:01:10,537
the Available tab

49
00:01:10,537 --> 00:01:12,077
shows the photos, prices

50
00:01:12,077 --> 00:01:14,097
and mileage for each vehicle.

51
00:01:14,097 --> 00:01:15,287
You're choosing

52
00:01:15,287 --> 00:01:16,307
from the dealership's

53
00:01:16,307 --> 00:01:17,327
existing information,

54
00:01:17,327 --> 00:01:18,917
rather than building every

55
00:01:18,917 --> 00:01:20,257
listing from a blank form.

56
00:01:20,257 --> 00:01:21,597
Maybe you want

57
00:01:21,597 --> 00:01:22,837
to feature a fresh arrival,

58
00:01:22,837 --> 00:01:23,927
or a few trucks

59
00:01:23,927 --> 00:01:24,947
that just came in.

60
00:01:25,187 --> 00:01:26,207
Use the search

61
00:01:26,207 --> 00:01:27,547
and filters to find them,

62
00:01:27,547 --> 00:01:28,877
then select the vehicles

63
00:01:28,877 --> 00:01:29,897
you want to post.

64
00:01:30,067 --> 00:01:31,837
Here I've selected four,

65
00:01:31,867 --> 00:01:33,367
and the Post to Marketplace

66
00:01:33,367 --> 00:01:34,997
button confirms that number.

67
00:01:35,297 --> 00:01:36,697
The vehicle cards stay

68
00:01:36,697 --> 00:01:37,897
in view, so you can

69
00:01:37,897 --> 00:01:39,267
check the details and photos

70
00:01:39,267 --> 00:01:40,287
before starting.

71
00:01:40,647 --> 00:01:41,907
You can keep the original

72
00:01:41,907 --> 00:01:43,167
images or choose

73
00:01:43,167 --> 00:01:44,737
an optional AI background.

74
00:01:45,147 --> 00:01:46,167
When you're ready,

75
00:01:46,167 --> 00:01:47,897
choose Post to Marketplace.

76
00:01:48,277 --> 00:01:49,297
AutoLander takes

77
00:01:49,297 --> 00:01:50,677
care of the repetitive listing

78
00:01:50,677 --> 00:01:52,457
preparation and posting steps,

79
00:01:52,567 --> 00:01:54,067
one vehicle at a time.

80
00:01:54,067 --> 00:01:55,767
You can check progress

81
00:01:55,767 --> 00:01:57,627
in the Queue while AutoLander

82
00:01:57,627 --> 00:01:59,617
prepares and posts each vehicle.

83
00:01:59,667 --> 00:02:00,997
It takes time;

84
00:02:00,997 --> 00:02:02,087
you don't have to sit

85
00:02:02,087 --> 00:02:03,107
and watch every step.

86
00:02:03,317 --> 00:02:04,437
You can carry on with

87
00:02:04,437 --> 00:02:05,697
other work and come back

88
00:02:05,697 --> 00:02:07,347
to check each vehicle's status.

89
00:02:07,577 --> 00:02:09,457
In this batch, two vehicles

90
00:02:09,457 --> 00:02:10,767
are published and the rest

91
00:02:10,767 --> 00:02:11,787
are still processing.

92
00:02:12,367 --> 00:02:13,757
Posted to FB is

93
00:02:13,757 --> 00:02:15,197
where you review your listings.

94
00:02:15,347 --> 00:02:16,417
And here's how

95
00:02:16,417 --> 00:02:17,527
a finished listing looks

96
00:02:17,527 --> 00:02:18,997
to a shopper on Marketplace.

97
00:02:19,200 --> 00:02:20,780
Choosing vehicles yourself is

98
00:02:20,780 --> 00:02:21,800
useful when you have

99
00:02:21,800 --> 00:02:23,240
something specific in mind.

100
00:02:23,300 --> 00:02:25,030
For the day-to-day routine,

101
00:02:25,210 --> 00:02:26,410
there's Auto-Pilot.

102
00:02:26,430 --> 00:02:28,120
In Post to Market,

103
00:02:28,180 --> 00:02:29,440
open Configure.

104
00:02:29,840 --> 00:02:31,200
Set your posting window,

105
00:02:31,360 --> 00:02:32,400
choose the inventory

106
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:34,080
and photo options you want,

107
00:02:34,080 --> 00:02:35,960
then turn Auto-Pilot on.

108
00:02:36,150 --> 00:02:37,230
It handles more

109
00:02:37,230 --> 00:02:38,250
than new posts.

110
00:02:38,330 --> 00:02:39,360
When prices

111
00:02:39,360 --> 00:02:41,080
change or vehicles are marked

112
00:02:41,080 --> 00:02:42,580
sold in your connected inventory

113
00:02:42,580 --> 00:02:44,860
source, Auto-Pilot can apply

114
00:02:44,860 --> 00:02:46,260
those changes to the matching

115
00:02:46,260 --> 00:02:47,500
listings you've already

116
00:02:47,500 --> 00:02:48,900
posted through AutoLander.

117
00:02:48,900 --> 00:02:51,190
For example, your manager

118
00:02:51,190 --> 00:02:52,310
might reduce a price

119
00:02:52,310 --> 00:02:53,410
in the Cars dot com

120
00:02:53,410 --> 00:02:54,890
feed or your connected

121
00:02:54,890 --> 00:02:55,930
inventory system.

122
00:02:56,290 --> 00:02:57,570
That change can carry

123
00:02:57,570 --> 00:02:58,870
through to the corresponding

124
00:02:58,870 --> 00:02:59,910
Facebook listing.

125
00:02:59,970 --> 00:03:01,520
You don't have to compare

126
00:03:01,520 --> 00:03:03,000
every listing by hand.

127
00:03:03,300 --> 00:03:05,000
Keep the computer powered on,

128
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:06,320
connected to the internet,

129
00:03:06,380 --> 00:03:07,780
and AutoLander running.

130
00:03:07,920 --> 00:03:08,970
You can minimize

131
00:03:08,970 --> 00:03:09,990
the app and get

132
00:03:09,990 --> 00:03:11,010
on with your day;

133
00:03:11,010 --> 00:03:12,030
don't close it

134
00:03:12,030 --> 00:03:13,230
or shut down the computer.

135
00:03:13,230 --> 00:03:15,060
A quick daily check,

136
00:03:15,100 --> 00:03:16,740
especially after a restart,

137
00:03:16,810 --> 00:03:17,830
helps you confirm

138
00:03:17,830 --> 00:03:19,270
that your connections are ready

139
00:03:19,270 --> 00:03:20,780
and Auto-Pilot is on.

140
00:03:21,153 --> 00:03:22,173
Let's look at what

141
00:03:22,173 --> 00:03:23,523
the shopper actually reads.

142
00:03:23,993 --> 00:03:25,013
AutoLander helps

143
00:03:25,013 --> 00:03:26,083
prepare the description

144
00:03:26,083 --> 00:03:27,383
from the vehicle information

145
00:03:27,383 --> 00:03:29,043
and your listing settings.

146
00:03:29,533 --> 00:03:30,553
Here you can

147
00:03:30,553 --> 00:03:31,893
see the complete feature list

148
00:03:31,893 --> 00:03:32,913
with emojis,

149
00:03:32,913 --> 00:03:34,573
followed by the dealership

150
00:03:34,573 --> 00:03:36,413
information and contact details.

151
00:03:36,593 --> 00:03:37,783
You shape that

152
00:03:37,783 --> 00:03:38,953
wording in Configuration,

153
00:03:39,233 --> 00:03:40,393
under Post Style.

154
00:03:40,903 --> 00:03:41,923
Dealer Playbook

155
00:03:41,923 --> 00:03:43,123
is where your dealership's

156
00:03:43,123 --> 00:03:44,143
information belongs.

157
00:03:44,643 --> 00:03:45,663
Start with the example

158
00:03:45,663 --> 00:03:46,683
in the app, then

159
00:03:46,683 --> 00:03:47,703
make it your own.

160
00:03:47,783 --> 00:03:49,043
This keeps your listings

161
00:03:49,043 --> 00:03:50,123
consistent without

162
00:03:50,123 --> 00:03:51,603
typing the same dealership

163
00:03:51,603 --> 00:03:53,083
information for every vehicle.

164
00:03:53,623 --> 00:03:55,243
Our sample includes financing

165
00:03:55,243 --> 00:03:57,243
available, trade-ins welcome,

166
00:03:57,283 --> 00:03:58,883
and Spanish-speaking assistance.

167
00:03:59,263 --> 00:04:01,373
The finished listing also shows

168
00:04:01,373 --> 00:04:02,733
the dealership's fee wording.

169
00:04:03,043 --> 00:04:04,503
Use statements your store

170
00:04:04,503 --> 00:04:06,003
has approved and services

171
00:04:06,003 --> 00:04:07,223
it actually offers.

172
00:04:07,783 --> 00:04:09,183
My Listing Additions puts

173
00:04:09,183 --> 00:04:10,623
your closing information at the

174
00:04:10,623 --> 00:04:11,823
bottom of the description.

175
00:04:11,823 --> 00:04:14,423
A simple example is: Please

176
00:04:14,473 --> 00:04:15,553
message me for more

177
00:04:15,553 --> 00:04:16,723
pictures and information.

178
00:04:16,763 --> 00:04:17,783
My phone

179
00:04:17,783 --> 00:04:18,853
number is in my bio.

180
00:04:19,343 --> 00:04:20,613
Then add your approved

181
00:04:20,613 --> 00:04:21,633
contact email.

182
00:04:22,033 --> 00:04:23,213
If you want shoppers

183
00:04:23,213 --> 00:04:24,593
to call, put your business

184
00:04:24,593 --> 00:04:26,053
number in your Facebook profile

185
00:04:26,053 --> 00:04:27,763
bio too, and check

186
00:04:27,763 --> 00:04:28,963
that it's visible to them.

187
00:04:29,183 --> 00:04:30,383
That's a separate step

188
00:04:30,383 --> 00:04:31,453
from Listing Additions.

189
00:04:32,103 --> 00:04:33,683
Back on the finished listing,

190
00:04:33,713 --> 00:04:34,733
you can see how it

191
00:04:34,733 --> 00:04:36,393
comes together: the vehicle

192
00:04:36,393 --> 00:04:38,133
details, the dealership's

193
00:04:38,133 --> 00:04:39,563
information, and a clear

194
00:04:39,563 --> 00:04:40,583
way to reach you,

195
00:04:40,583 --> 00:04:41,833
all in one description.

196
00:04:41,833 --> 00:04:43,923
The first photo is another

197
00:04:43,923 --> 00:04:45,123
part of that presentation.

198
00:04:45,623 --> 00:04:47,363
Here's the original dealership

199
00:04:47,363 --> 00:04:48,763
image, and here's the same

200
00:04:48,763 --> 00:04:50,323
vehicle with an AI background.

201
00:04:50,853 --> 00:04:52,193
It can be useful when

202
00:04:52,193 --> 00:04:53,333
the original has a busy

203
00:04:53,333 --> 00:04:55,193
dealership background and you'd

204
00:04:55,193 --> 00:04:56,433
prefer a cleaner setting.

205
00:04:56,753 --> 00:04:58,093
You can choose the background

206
00:04:58,093 --> 00:04:59,463
style in Post Style.

207
00:04:59,873 --> 00:05:00,893
First Photo is

208
00:05:00,893 --> 00:05:02,263
a practical starting point:

209
00:05:02,283 --> 00:05:03,383
you get a different

210
00:05:03,383 --> 00:05:04,623
lead image without applying

211
00:05:04,623 --> 00:05:06,263
the option to every photograph.

212
00:05:06,993 --> 00:05:08,533
AI credits are separate

213
00:05:08,533 --> 00:05:09,833
from your posting allowance,

214
00:05:09,873 --> 00:05:11,053
so check the current

215
00:05:11,053 --> 00:05:12,133
cost in the app.

216
00:05:12,343 --> 00:05:13,783
Then review the result

217
00:05:13,783 --> 00:05:14,883
and make sure it still

218
00:05:14,883 --> 00:05:16,303
shows the vehicle accurately.

219
00:05:16,463 --> 00:05:17,483
You can also

220
00:05:17,483 --> 00:05:19,203
include Facebook buy-and-sell

221
00:05:19,203 --> 00:05:20,663
groups in your posting routine.

222
00:05:21,103 --> 00:05:23,303
In Configuration, open My

223
00:05:23,303 --> 00:05:24,753
Groups and choose the groups

224
00:05:24,753 --> 00:05:25,773
you want to use.

225
00:05:25,933 --> 00:05:26,993
Focus on groups

226
00:05:26,993 --> 00:05:28,033
that fit your area

227
00:05:28,033 --> 00:05:29,493
and the vehicles you sell.

228
00:05:29,763 --> 00:05:31,483
Their rules and approval process

229
00:05:31,483 --> 00:05:33,323
still apply, so selecting

230
00:05:33,323 --> 00:05:34,543
a group doesn't guarantee

231
00:05:34,543 --> 00:05:35,613
that its administrators

232
00:05:35,613 --> 00:05:36,843
will publish the post.

233
00:05:37,133 --> 00:05:38,233
Now, what happens

234
00:05:38,233 --> 00:05:39,513
when the inventory changes?

235
00:05:39,993 --> 00:05:41,353
Listing Updates brings

236
00:05:41,353 --> 00:05:43,113
those changes into one place.

237
00:05:43,213 --> 00:05:44,513
Here you can see

238
00:05:44,513 --> 00:05:45,673
the old and new prices,

239
00:05:45,733 --> 00:05:46,833
alongside vehicles

240
00:05:46,833 --> 00:05:48,233
no longer in the feed.

241
00:05:48,693 --> 00:05:50,373
After a price update completes

242
00:05:50,373 --> 00:05:51,993
successfully, the Facebook

243
00:05:51,993 --> 00:05:53,693
listing reflects that new price.

244
00:05:53,893 --> 00:05:55,983
To process changes manually,

245
00:05:56,183 --> 00:05:57,763
select the vehicles individually

246
00:05:57,863 --> 00:05:59,643
or use Select All,

247
00:05:59,683 --> 00:06:01,823
then choose Process Updates.

248
00:06:01,843 --> 00:06:02,863
The cards

249
00:06:02,863 --> 00:06:04,053
help you see which action

250
00:06:04,053 --> 00:06:05,273
applies to each vehicle.

251
00:06:05,513 --> 00:06:06,533
Here we're

252
00:06:06,533 --> 00:06:07,813
processing a sold vehicle.

253
00:06:07,913 --> 00:06:09,103
You can follow

254
00:06:09,103 --> 00:06:10,363
it through the Queue, then

255
00:06:10,363 --> 00:06:11,583
see Done when the action

256
00:06:11,583 --> 00:06:12,703
finishes successfully.

257
00:06:13,233 --> 00:06:14,633
With Auto-Pilot running,

258
00:06:14,833 --> 00:06:16,173
AutoLander handles this

259
00:06:16,173 --> 00:06:17,473
routine maintenance for you.

260
00:06:17,473 --> 00:06:18,493
You don't need

261
00:06:18,493 --> 00:06:19,513
to keep watching the

262
00:06:19,513 --> 00:06:20,533
Listing Updates page.

263
00:06:20,673 --> 00:06:22,013
If an older listing

264
00:06:22,013 --> 00:06:23,473
is still available and you

265
00:06:23,473 --> 00:06:24,733
want to advertise it again,

266
00:06:24,913 --> 00:06:26,493
go to Post to Market,

267
00:06:26,513 --> 00:06:28,133
then Posted to FB,

268
00:06:28,133 --> 00:06:30,433
beside Available and Queue.

269
00:06:30,693 --> 00:06:32,453
Choose Repost on the vehicle,

270
00:06:32,533 --> 00:06:33,573
and the blue Delete

271
00:06:33,573 --> 00:06:35,193
and Repost control appears.

272
00:06:35,453 --> 00:06:37,113
That deletes the original

273
00:06:37,113 --> 00:06:38,313
listing published through

274
00:06:38,313 --> 00:06:39,633
AutoLander and creates

275
00:06:39,633 --> 00:06:40,653
a fresh Marketplace

276
00:06:40,653 --> 00:06:41,933
listing for that vehicle.

277
00:06:42,243 --> 00:06:43,903
It's a new listing, rather

278
00:06:43,903 --> 00:06:44,923
than an edit to the

279
00:06:44,923 --> 00:06:45,993
wording in the old one.

280
00:06:46,263 --> 00:06:47,303
Check that the vehicle

281
00:06:47,303 --> 00:06:48,803
and its details are still

282
00:06:48,803 --> 00:06:50,443
current before you repost it.

283
00:06:50,653 --> 00:06:51,673
When a shopper

284
00:06:51,673 --> 00:06:52,853
messages about a vehicle,

285
00:06:52,893 --> 00:06:54,193
the conversation comes

286
00:06:54,193 --> 00:06:55,453
to your Facebook Messenger,

287
00:06:55,593 --> 00:06:57,553
on your computer or phone.

288
00:06:57,993 --> 00:06:59,453
Keep notifications on

289
00:06:59,453 --> 00:07:01,033
so you can respond promptly.

290
00:07:01,353 --> 00:07:02,933
AutoLander handles posting

291
00:07:02,933 --> 00:07:04,333
and price updates while

292
00:07:04,333 --> 00:07:05,633
you focus on the customer.

293
00:07:05,733 --> 00:07:07,473
For managers, there's

294
00:07:07,473 --> 00:07:08,593
a team view as well.

295
00:07:09,023 --> 00:07:10,223
Manager Dashboard

296
00:07:10,223 --> 00:07:11,523
shows the posting activity

297
00:07:11,523 --> 00:07:12,983
available for your team,

298
00:07:13,003 --> 00:07:14,123
so you can see where

299
00:07:14,123 --> 00:07:15,203
someone may need help.

300
00:07:15,513 --> 00:07:16,663
It's a useful starting

301
00:07:16,663 --> 00:07:17,683
point for coaching:

302
00:07:17,773 --> 00:07:19,853
review the activity, then work

